    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present No. 40 Summerseat Court to the market, a beautifully presented two-bedroom mid-terrace home with the added benefit of a superb light filled converted attic. This exceptional property is presented in turnkey condition and offers stylish, contemporary living throughout. This impressive home will appeal to first-time buyers, young families and discerning investors alike.\n \nA welcoming entrance hallway sets the tone for the home, featuring decorative wall panelling and bespoke built-in storage under the staircase. To the front, the contemporary kitchen/breakfast room is fitted with an excellent range of quality wall and floor-mounted units, complemented by a butcher's block countertop. A spacious living room opens directly onto the private rear garden through double doors, creating an ideal space for both everyday living and entertaining.\n \nUpstairs comprises of two generous double bedrooms, the main bedroom features fitted wardrobes and a stylish en-suite. A modern family shower room completes this level. The converted attic on the second floor provides a bright and versatile space, enhanced by four large skylights, making it ideal as a home office, playroom, gym or guest accommodation.\n \nThe private rear garden is a wonderful extension of the living space, featuring wooden decking, lawn area, and a garden shed, perfect for outdoor dining and relaxation.\n \nSummerseat Court enjoys an enviable position within this peaceful development. Clonee Village is on your doorstep offering an excellent selection of shops and cafés with nearby schools and local amenities. The area is exceptionally well connected, with regular bus services, nearby rail links and convenient access to the N3 and M50, ensuring Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas are easily accessible.\n\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.85m x 1.28m\nA welcoming entrance hallway featuring decorative wall panelling and bespoke built-in storage to include a pull-out coat rail, providing both style and practicality.\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Room - 4.80m x 2.29m\nBeautifully appointed with quality wall and floor-mounted cabinetry, offering excellent storage and complemented by butcher's block worktop. Integrated appliances include an electric hob with extractor, oven, microwave, dishwasher, sink and integrated waste bins. The room is finished with large-format floor tiling, decorative ceiling and wall panelling.\n\nLiving Room - 4.17m x 4.24m\nA spacious and light-filled reception room overlooking the rear garden, featuring double doors that open directly onto a wooden deck, creating a seamless connection between the indoor and outdoor living spaces. Finished with large-format floor tiling.\n\nLanding - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.25m x 2.80m\nA generous double bedroom overlooking the rear garden, complete with fitted wardrobe and a contemporary en-suite bathroom. Finished with Large format laminate flooring.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.22m x 0.82m\nStylishly finished and fully tiled, comprising a shower, vanity unit, WC and built-in storage.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.26m x 2.85m\nDouble bedroom to the front of the property, finished with laminate timber flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.98m x 1.67m\nModern fully tiled shower room, comprising a shower, vanity unit, WC and includes additional built-in storage.\n\nConverted Attic - 5.49m x 4.22m\nA bright and versatile room flooded with natural light from four large skylights. Finished with laminate timber flooring, this impressive space lends itself to a variety of uses including a home office, family room or guest accommodation.\n\n"
      },
      {
